<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 11.01 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 11.01 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Tuesday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on June 30 was 11.01 percent.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between</p>
<p>India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>	  The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari</p>
<p>Pioneer's other mutual funds.. -------</p>
<p>    Name of Fund				NAV(Rs.per share)</p>
<p>    ------------				-----------------</p>
<p>    Prima fund					 10.06</p>
<p>    Prima plus					  7.54</p>
<p>    Bluechip fund				    13.57</p>
<p>    Taxshield	95				 8.06</p>
<p>			 96				12.22</p>
<p>			 97				  --</p>
